<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="GAL" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gala</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Galaatiya Asaas Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Galaatiya Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusi ashsheyssa gideyssa odiya Wonggelaa qaalay dumma dumma bessan sabbakettin, Ayhude gidonna asay ammani ammani biya wode, “Kiristtaane gidanaw Muse higge polanaw koshshiyye koshshennee?” yaagiya oyshoy issife denddis. He wode Phawuloosi, “Kiristtaane gidanaw Muse higge polanaw koshshenna; Yesuusan ooratha de7o demmanaw koshshiya waannay, ammano. Asay Xoossaa sinthan xillanaw dandda7ey ammano xalaalan” yaagidi tamaarssis. Shin Guutha Iisiyan, Galaatiya awurajjan de7iya woosa keethan de7iya asaa giddon, “Asi Xoossaa sinthan xillanaw Yesuusa ammano xalaala gidonnashin, Muse higgiyaka polanaw koshshees” yaagidi Phawuloosa timirttiya phalqqiya asati de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Galaatiya maxaafaa xaafiday he balaa timirtten cimettida asaa tuma ammanuwaakkonne ammano de7uwakko zaaranaassa. Phawuloosi Yesuusa hawaare gideyssa tillaydi odo oykkis. Iya hawaare oothidi xeegiday ase gidonnashin Xoossaa gideyssanne I kiitettiday Ayhude gidonna asaas gideyssa qonccisidi odis. Iyara oysethidi asay xillanaw dandda7ey ammano xalaalan gideyssa odees. Wurssetha shemppotan ammano de7oy Yesuusa ammanon benttiya siiqoppe pultteyssa gideyssa odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galaatiya kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretetha maata 1:11-2:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa Wonggelaa 3:1-4:31</para>
  <para style="io1">La77atethinne ammanon duussu 5:1-6:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 6:11-18</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Asappe woykko asa baggara gidonnashin, Yesuus Kiristtoosappenne iya hayqoppe denthida Xoossaa Aawappe hawaare gidana mela kiitettida ta Phawuloosi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>taara de7iya ammaniyaa ishati ubbay, Galaatiyan de7iya woosa keethatas kiittida kiitaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay nu Aawaynne nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosi hinttew aadho keehatethaanne sarotethaa immo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ha iita wodiyappe nuna ashshanaw, nu Xoossaa, nu Aawa shenen Kiristtoosi nu nagara gisho bana aathi immis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossaas Merinaappe merinaa gakkanaw bonchchoy gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuma Wonggelay issino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethan hinttena xeegida Xoossaa aggidi, hara Wonggelaakko, hintte ellesidi, waanidi simmidaakko tana malaalisees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hinttena balethanawunne Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa wobbisanw koyaa guutha asati de7oosonappe attin tuma Wonggelay issino. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin nuna gidin woykko salo kiitanchcho gidin nuuni hinttew koyro odida Wonggelaappe dummattiya hara Wonggelaa hinttew odiyabaa gidikko, I qanggettidabaa gido. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hayssafe sinthe nuuni gidayssada ha77ika zaarada gays. Hintte ekkida Wonggelaappe dummattiya Wonggelaa oonikka hinttew odikko he uray qanggettidabaa gido.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yaatin, tana asi nashshana mela koyaynayye? Woykko Xoossi nashshana mela koyaynaa? Woykko ta ase ufayssanaw koyaynaa? Ta ase ufayssanaw koyabaa gidikko, Kiristtoosa aylle gidikke.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta hinttew odida Wonggelay asappe gidonnayssa hintte erana mela ta koyays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Taw ha Wonggelaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosi qonccisisippe attin asappe ekkabiikke woykko asi tana tamaarssibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta kase Ayhude ammanon de7iya wode waana de7idaakko, hintte si7ideta. Ta woosa keethaa qadhey baynna gooddanawnne dhayssanaw baaxetas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ha@O 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ayhude ammano naagon, ta woden de7iya Ayhude ishatappe aadhdhays. Nu aawata wogaaskka aadhdhada mishettays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Ha@O 22:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin ta buroo ta aaye ulon de7ishin Xoossay tana dooris; ba aadho keehatethan tana xeegis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Ha@O 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ayhude gidonna asaas Wonggelaa odana mela Xoossay ba Na7aa taw qonccisida wode ta ooderakka zorettabiikke. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Woykko taappe sinthe hawaare gididayssatara gayttanaw Yerusalaame babiikke. Shin ta kasetada Arabe biittaa bas; hessafe simmada Damasqqo katamaa yas. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Heedzu laythafe guye, Phexiroosara gayttanaw Yerusalaame bada iyara tammanne ichchashu gallas uttas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Ha@O 9:26-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Godaa ishaa Yayqoobappe attin hankko hawaareta be7abiikke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta hinttew xaafiydayssi worddo gidonnayssa Xoossaa sinthan hinttew qonccisays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, taani Sooriya biittaanne Kilqiya biittaa bas. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yihudan de7iya woosa keethaa asay tana be7idi eribookkona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin entti, “Kase nuna gooddiya uray, ha77i he I dhayssanaw koyaa ammanuwabaa sabbakees” yaageyssa si7idosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Si7ida ubbay ta gaason Xoossaa galatidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hawaareti Phawuloosa ekkidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tammanne oyddu laythafe guye, Barnnabaasara zaarada Yerusalaame bas. He wode Tito taara ekkada bas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Ha@O 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossay taw qonccisida qonccethan yaa bada Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon ta sabbakiya Wonggelaa enttaw qonccisas. Kase ta woxxida wothaynne ha77ika ta woxxiya wothay hada gidonna mela gada kaaletheyssata dumma shiishada enttaw odas. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, taara de7iya Titoy Girike asi gidikkoka, qaxxaretto gidi un77ethibookkona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gidoshin, ammaniyaa ishata daanidi nu giddo gelida issoti issoti I qaxxarettana mela koyidosona. He asati Kiristtoos Yesuusan nuus de7iya la77atethaa wochchidi be7anaw geeman nu giddo gelidi zaaridi nuna aylle oothanaw koyoosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin tuma Wonggelaa hinttenan minnidi daana mela nuuni hari attoshin, guutha wodeskka enttaw kushe immibookko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin halaqa daaniya asata oonatethay taw aykkoka gidenna. Xoossay asa som77o be7idi pirddenna. Ha asati ta markkattiya Wonggelaa bolla gujjidabay baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, Ayhudetas Wonggelaa odana mela Xoossay iyaw hadara immidayssada tawukka Ayhude gidonna asaas Wonggelaa odiya hadaraa immidayssa entti guyeppe be7idosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hiza, Phexiroosi Ayhudeta hawaare gidana mela oothida Xoossay, takka Ayhude gidonna asaas hawaare gidana mela oothis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassi tuussu daanidi benttiya Yayqoobi, Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi, taw imettida aadho keehatethaa be7ida wode nuura issifidayssa qonccisanaw ta kushiyanne Barnnabaasa kushiya oykkidosona. Nuuni Ayhude gidonna asaakko, qassi entti Ayhude asaakko baanaw giigidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Entti nuna minthidi hadara giday, nuuni manqotas qoppanayssa. Kasekka ta hessa oothanaw amotteys.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Phexiroosa timirttiya phalqqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Anxookiya katamaa yida wode I balida gisho taani iya som77on “Neeni baladasa” gas. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yayqoobi kiittida guutha asay yaanappe sinthe I Ayhude gidonna asaara mees, shin entti yidaappe guye, “Ayhude gidonna asaappe ammanidayssati qaxxarettanaw bessees” giya asaas yayyidi enttafe shaakettis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qassi hankko ammanida Ayhudeti Phexiroosa hanuwa Kaallidosona. Hari attoshin, Barnnabaasikka iya qofan gooshettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin entti Wonggelaa tumatethan suure hamuttonnayssa be7ada, Phexiroosa asa ubbaa sinthan, “Neeni Ayhude gidashe, Ayhude wogaatho gidonnashin, Ayhude gidonna asada de7aasa; yaatin, waanada Ayhude gidonnayssata, ‘Ayhude wogan de7ite gada wolqqatay?’ ” yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nuuni yeletan Ayhude, shin nagaranchcho gidida Ayhude gidonna asaa mela gidokko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin asi Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanidi xilleesippe attin higge naagidi xillonnayssa eroos. Oonikka higge naagidi xillonna gisho, nukka higge naagidi gidonnashin, Kiristtoosan ammanidi xillana mela Kiristtoosi Yesuusa ammanida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Roome 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nu Ayhudetikka Kiristtoosa baggara xillanaw koshshees. Hessa gidikko nukka hara asada nagaranchcho gideyssa be7oos. Yaatin, nu nagara oothana mela denthethey Kiristtoosa guusseyye? Ubbaka gidenna! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hiza, ta laallidayssa zaarada keexiyabaa gidikko taani ta huu7en higge mentheyssa gideyssa qonccisays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani Xoossaas daana mela taani higge baggara higges hayqqas. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani Kiristtoosara masqaliya bolla kaqettas. Taani hizappe taw de7ikke, shin Kiristtoosi tanan de7ees. Ta ha77i de7iya de7oy, tana dosidi ta gisho bana aathi immida Xoossaa Na7aa ammanada de7ays. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa hada oothike. Xillotethi asas higge baggara benttiyabaa gidiyakko, Kiristtoosi coo hayqqis guussu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xillotethi ammanonna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, akeeki baynna Galaatiya asato, hintte ayfiyaa sinthan Kiristtoosi masqale bolla kaqettida misileda qonccidi benttees. Yaatin, tumaas hintte kiitettonna mela hinttena bitiday oonee? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta issibaa eranaw koyays; hintte Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkiday higge naagidiyye woykko hintte si7ida Wonggelaa ammanidi ekkideti? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hintte hessa mela eeye? Hintte Xoossaa Ayyaanan doomidi, ha77i wolqqan polanaw koyeetii? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hintte Wonggelaa gaason daro waayettiday melee? He waaye ubbay coo gididee? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttew Geeshsha Ayyaana immeynne hintte giddon malaatata oothey, hintte higge naagida gishoyye woykko Wonggelaa si7idi ammanida gisho?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ane Abrahaame be7ite, “I Xoossaa ammanis; Xoossay iyaw hessa xillotethi oothidi ekkis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medhe 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Roome 4:3</ref></char></note> geetettidi xaafettis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hiza, ammaneyssati Abrahaame nayta gideyssa erite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Roome 4:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossay Ayhude gidonna asaa ammanon xillisanayssa Geeshsha Maxaafay be7idi, “Kawotetha ubbay nenan anjjettana” yaagidi, Wonggelaa Abrahames kasetidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Medhe 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ammaniyaa ubbay ammanida Abrahamera issife anjjettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Higge naagidi xillana giya oonikka qanggettidayssa. Ays giikko, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Higge maxaafan xaafettida ubbaa naagonna oonikka qanggettidayssa gido” geetettidi xaafettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Zaare 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Xilloy ammanon daana” geetettidi xaafettida gisho, oonikka Xoossaa sinthan higge naagidi xillonnayssi erettidabaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ib 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Higgey ammanon zemppenna. Shin, “Higgiya naagiya oonikka higgiyan de7on daana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mitha bolla kaqettidi hayqqiya oonikka qanggettidayssa” geetetti xaafettida gisho, Kiristtoosi nu gisho qanggettidayssa gididi, nuna higge qanggethafe wozis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Zaare 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossay Abrahames immida anjjoy, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Ayhude gidonna asaa gakkana melanne Xoossay immana gida Geeshsha Ayyaana nuuni ammanon ekkana mela hessa oothis.</para>
  <para style="s">Higgenne ufayssa qaalaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta hinttew asa de7on meeze gididi de7iyabaa leemiso oothada odays. Asi caaqqida caaqoy minnidaappe guye, oonikka he caaquwa shaaranaw woykko iya bolla haraa gujjanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossay he keeke qaalaa Abrahamesinne iya zerethaas immis. Geeshsha Maxaafay, daro asas odiyada, “Ne zerethatas” geenna. Shin issi asas odiyada, “Ne zerethaas” yaagees; ikka Kiristtoosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani gey hayssa; oyddu xeetanne hasttamu laythafe guye imettida higgey, koyro Xoossay minthida caaquwa shaaridi ufayssa qaala dhayssanaw dandda7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kessa 12:40</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xoossay immiya laatay higgen ekettiyabaa gidiyakko Xoossay immida ufayssaa baggara gideyssi attees. Shin Xoossay ba aadho keehatethan laata Abrahames ufayssa qaala baggara immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Roome 4:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yaatin, higgey ays imettidee? Higgey imettiday, Abrahames ufayssa qaali imettida zerethay yaana gakkanaw iita oosoy aybeekko erisanaassa. Higgey kiitanchchota baggara imettidi, gido gididi sigethiya issi asa baggara ooso bolla pee7is. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Giddo gididi sigethiya uray issi asa xalaalas gidenna, shin Xoossay issino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yaatin, higgey Xoossaa ufayssa qaalara eqettiyye? Akkay, gidenna! Higgey imettiday asas de7o immanaw gidiyakko, xillotethi higge baggara benttanashin. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanin benttiya ufayssa qaalay ammaneyssatas imettana mela kumetha alamey nagaras haarettidi de7eyssa Geeshsha Maxaafay odees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin ammanoy yaanappe kase higgey nuna qachchi wothis. He ammanoy qonccana gakkanaw higgey nu bolla gorddi wothis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni ammanon xillana mela Kiristtoosi yaana gakkanaw higgey na7a naagiya asa mela nuna naageyssa gidis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin ha77i ammanoy yida gisho, higgey hizappe guye na7a naagiya asa mela nuna naageyssi attis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanidi Xoossaa nayta gidideta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kiristtoosara issino gidanaw xammaqettida ubbay Kiristtoosa ma7oda ma77ideta. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay Kiristtoosan issino gidiya gisho, Ayhude asaa giddoninne Girike asaa giddon, aylle giddoninne womaanno giddon, adde giddoninne maccasa giddon dummatethi baawa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte Kiristtoosabaa gidikko hintte Abrahaame zare. Xoossaa ufayssa qaalada hintte laatteyssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Roome 4:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta geyssi hayssa. Laattey na7aa gidi de7ishe, shalo ubbay iyabaa gidikkoka, I ayllefe aykkoka dummatenna. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin iya aaway gida wodey gakkanaw I hadara ekkidayssata kusheninne naageyssata kushen de7ees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessadakka, nuuni na7atethan de7iya wode alamiya wogaas ayllettidi de7ida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin wodey gakkida wode Xoossay higgefe garssan, maccasappe yelettida ba na7aa kiittis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>I hessa oothiday, higges haarettidi de7eyssata wozanawunne nuna ba nayta oothanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Roome 8:15-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu Xoossaa nayta gidiya gisho, “Abbaa, Aawaw” gidi xeegiya ba Na7aa Ayyaana nu wozanaa giddo kiittis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hizappe neeni Xoossaa na7appe attin aylle gidakka. Neeni iya na7a gidikko, Xoossaa laatteyssa gidadasa.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Galaatiya asaas qoppis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte kase Xoossaa eronna wode xoosse gidonnayssatas aylle gididi haarettideta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin ha77i hintte Xoossaa erideta; ubbarakka Xoossan erettideta. Yaatin pathonnanne go77onna alame wogatakko guye waanidi simmeetii? Wodhdhi eqqidi, waanidi enttaw aylle gidanaw koyeetii? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Dumma gidida gallasata, ageenata, wodetanne laythata hintte loythi bonchcheta. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tana hinttebay yashshees; ta hinttew coo daaburadinaashsha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta hintteda hanida gisho, hintteka taada hanite gada hinttena woossays. Hintte tana aybinkka qohibeekketa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Taani koyro harggettashe hinttew Wonggelaa odidayssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta harggey hinttew paace gidikkoka, tana saletibekketa; ixxibeeketa. Shin tana Xoossaa kiitanchcho woykko Kiristtoos Yesuusa mokkeyssada mokkideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yaatin, he hinttew de7iya ufayssay ubbay aw bidee? Hinttew dandda7ettidaakko, hintte taw, hintte ayfiyaa kessidi immiyako ixxonnayssa ta markkattays. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaatin, ta hinttew tuma odida gisho hinttew morkke gidadinaayye?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>He asati hinttena banttako zaaranaw koyoosona, shin entta qofay lo77ossa gidenna. Entta qofay hinttena shaakkanaassanne hintte enttaw qoppana mela oothanaassa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lo77obaa oothanaw amottiko lo77o, shin hessi ta hinttera de7iya wode xalaala gidonnashin ubba wode gido.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta siiqo nayto, Kiristtoosi hinttenan misilettana gakkanaw yelos maccasi miixotteyssada ta hintte gisho miixottays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hinttebay taw haddirssi gidin ta un77ettas; ha77i hintte giddon ta benttada shenetada odiyakko ay mela dosaynashin.</para>
  <para style="s">Aggaaronne Saaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Muse higgen haarettidi daanaw koyeyssato, ane taw odite; higgey ay giyakko erekketii? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Abrahames ayllefenne godattefe yelettida nam77u nayti de7oosona” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Medhe 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Aylle na7ay asi na7a yeliya maaran yelettis, shin godatte na7ay Xoossaa ufayssa qaalan yelettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ha maccasati nam77u caaqotas leemiso gididi ekettoosona. Enttafe issinniya, Siina Deriyappe yidaara, ba nayta aylletethas yelasu; iyakka Aggaaro. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Aggaara Arabe biittan de7iya Siina Deriyan leemisettada ha77i de7iya Yerusalaame daanawusu. Ays giikko, iya ba naytara aylletethan de7awusu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin salon de7iya Yerusalaamey aylletethan de7ukku; iya nu ubbaas aayo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q">“Naatte, yelonna maynthete ufaytta;</para>
  <para style="q2">naatte miixotta eronnaree ilila.</para>
  <para style="q">Azinara de7iya maccaseeppe,</para>
  <para style="q2">azini baynna maccasees nayti daro” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte Yisaaqada Xoossaa ufayssa qaalan yelettida nayta. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shin he wode asa maarada yelettidayssi, Ayyaana wolqqan yelettidayssa goodis. Hachchika hessa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Medhe 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin Geeshsha Maxaafay woygi? “Aylle na7ay godatte na7aara issife laattonna gisho, aylliw I na7aara wolla kessa yedda” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Medhe 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta ishato, nuuni godattee naytappe attin ayllee nayta gidokko.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan de7iya la77atethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni la77atethan daana mela Kiristtoosi nuna aylletethaafe kessis. Hiza, minnidi eqqite; zaaridi aylletetha qambbaran geloppite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta, Phawuloosi, geyssa si7ite. Hintte qaxxarettanaw koykko, Kiristtoosi hinttena aykkoka maaddenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Qaxxarettiya oonikka higgey kiittiya ubbaa polanaw besseyssa gujjada ta odays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Higge naagidi xillanaw koyeyssato, Kiristtoosappe shaakettideta; Xoossaa aadho keehatethaafe kunddideta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin nuuni Xoossaa Ayyaana baggara ammanon xillanaw ufayssan naagoos. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hiza, Kiristtoos Yesuusan de7ikko, siiqon qoncciya ammanoppe attin qaxxarettin, qaxxarettonna aggin nuna aykkoka maaddenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kase hintte lo77o woxxeeta, shin ha77i tumaas kiitettonna mela hinttena diggiday oonee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hayssa mela iita cimoy hinttena xeegida Xoossaafe yibeenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessika, “Guutha irshshoy munuqa ubbaa denthees.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1Qoro 5:6</ref></char></note> geetettidi xaafettidayssa mela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hinttew hara qofi baynnayssas ta Godan ammanettays. Shin hinttena buqiya oonikka Xoossafe ba pirddaa ekkana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta ha77i gakkanaw qaxxaro sabbakkiyabaa gidikko, yaatin tana ays gooddonaa? Hessi tuma gidiyakko Kiristtoosa masqaliyabaa tamaarssoy asaas dhube gidennashin. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hinttena buqeyssati qaxxaretetha xalaala gidonnashin, banttana qaaratiyakkoka ta dosays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte la77a daanaw xeegettideta. Gidoshin, hintte la77atethay asho amo polanaw hinttew gaaso gidoppo; hessafe aathidi issoy issuwa siiqon maaddite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Higge ubbay, “Ase needa dosa” yaagiya issi qaalan qashettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin hintte issoy issuwara saxetiyabaanne meetettiyabaa gidikko, hintte woli wurssonna mela naagettite.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayyaana de7onne asho de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hiza, ta hinttew odays; Ayyaanan de7ite; hintte asho amuwaa poloppite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Asho amoy Ayyaana amuwaara morkke; qassi Ayyaana amoykka asho amuwaara morkke. Entti issoy issuwara ixettiya gisho hintte dosiyabaa oothanaw dandda7ekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Roome 7:15-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Ayyaanay hinttena kaalethiyabaa gidikko higgey hinttena haarenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Asho oosoti erettidayssata; enttika, laymatethi, tunatethi, qayxe, <verse number="20" style="v"/>eeqa goynno, bita, morkketethi, kachchi, qanaate, hanqo, bana doso, shaaketethi, iita tobbe <verse number="21" style="v"/>gene, matho, yethinne hessa hessa melata. Kase ta hinttew odidayssada ha77ika ta hinttew odays. Hayssa melabata ootheyssati Xoossaa kawotethaa laattokona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Ayyaana ayfey, siiqo, ufayssi, sarotethi, dandda7a, keehatethi, lo77otethi, ammano, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ashkketethi, bana haaro. Hayssa melabata ixxiya higgey baawa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kiristtoos Yesuusabaa gididayssati bantta ashuwa iya iita qofaranne iya amuwaara issife masqaliya bolla kaqqidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu Ayyaanan de7iyabaa gidikko, nuna Ayyaanay kaaletho. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ane issoy issuwa yiloyishenne qanaatishe coo ceeqetteyssa aggoos.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Issoy issuwa maaddite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, issi asi nagaran kunddiko, Ayyaanan de7iya hintte he uraa ashkketethan suurisite. Shin neeni hessa melaban paacettonna mela nena naaga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issoy issuwa deexo toohuwa tookkite. Yaatikko Kiristtoosa higgiya poleeta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Issi asi aykkoyka baawashin, bana haratappe lo77o gidi qoppiko, I bana cimmees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin issi issi asi ba oosuwa paacco. Hessafe guye, haratara bana gaaddeyeyssa aggidi baw ceeqettiyabaa demmees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Issi issi asi ba toohuwa baw tookkanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaala tamaariya oonikka lo77obaa ubbaa ba asttamaariyara shaakettees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hinttee, hinttena cimmofite. Asi ba zeridabaa zaaridi cakkiya gisho Xoossaa bolla qelqisoppite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ba asho amuwaa kunthanaw zeriya oonikka, ba asho amuwaappe hayqo buuccana. Shin Ayyaanaa ufayssanaw zeriya oonikka Ayyaanaappe merinaa de7o cakkana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ane lo77o ooso oothanaw azalleyssa aggoos. Nuuni azallonna ixxiko wodey gakkiya wode nu zeridayssa cakkana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu injje wode demmiko, asa ubbaas, aathidikka ammaniyaa asaas lo77obaa oothoos.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha zorenne sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani ta kushen, ay mela gita pidaalen hinttew xaafidaakko be7ite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Asa sinthan lo77o gididi benttanaw koyaa asati hintte qaxxarettana mela koyoosona. Shin hessa entti oothey, Kiristtoosa masqaliya gisho enttana goodi gakkonna melassa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti hintte qaxxaretethan ceeqettanaw koyidi hinttena qaxxaretto goosonappe attin qaxxarettidayssatikka bantta huu7en higgiya naagokkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin alamey taw kaqettidayssafenne taanikka alamiyas kaqettida, Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa masqaliyappe attin hara ceeqetethi taappe haakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, qaxxarettin qaxxarettonna aggin aykkoka maaddenna. Maaddey ooratha medhetethi gido. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha wogaa kaalliya ubbaasinne Xoossaa dere gidida Isra7eeles sarotethaynne maarotethay gido.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani Yesuusas madunxida beeta ta asatethan tookkida gisho, hizappe tana oonikka waaysoppo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta ishato, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethay hinttera gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
